Package: bifurcatoR
Type: Package
Title: Hunt for bumps in high-dimensional (or low-dimensional!) data
Description: A special case of variance analysis exists when one group may have
    discernible forking in phenotypes over time. This library provides some
    tools to design experiments for such cases, along with some example data.
Version: 0.99.20240320
Date: 2024-03-20
